  m_Name: Occultist Zale
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Occultist Zale
  offerText: That gigantic, unsettling stone monolith in your corner is emitting
    strange energy. Let me drag it away for my research. It costs you nothing to
    be rid of it.
  acceptResultText: Zale painstakingly drags the creepy heavy stone out of your room.
    You feel a massive wave of relief, glad to have your floor space and sanity back.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to let a stranger take your property. The eerie monolith
    stays in your room, giving you terrible nightmares and a lingering headache.
  acceptedDelayedText: Zale returns laughing! He cracked the ugly monolith open and
    found it was completely filled with rare, glowing gemstones! He gives you a massive
    cut of the profits.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
